ies":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"lok1BFflfV17T04k-Q-G9Q","review_id":"rANmxXPipRrCnYFjZQFv-w","date":"2021-10-10T19:30:46","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9463754296302795,"text_excerpt":"This place is basically a combination of a bookstore and a coffee shop; it's such a cute place, I definitely want to come back someday. It's clear that there is a lot of thought put into the selection of literature, which includes stories from New Orleans, local authors, and admirable figures. I also loved how their specialty coffee is named after famous book titles, such as The Color Purple (such a refreshing and delicious drink, the taste of espresso is barely there) and If Beale Street Could Talk (a sweet velvety coffee with a kick). They also have a great selection of pastries, which differ by the day. I got the blueberry muffin, was topped by a delicious coating of sugar; my friend s..."},{"business_id":"lok1BFflfV17T04k-Q-G9Q","review_id":"ErmvOO6_ZVIM1tpMfGsAXA","date":"2021-03-31T15:40:02","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9357011914253235,"text_excerpt":"We're new to the neighborhood as well and we think we've found our new coffee shop, which just so happens to also be an amazing book store! Staff is friendly, drinks are delicious and reasonably priced. The shop itself it beautifully designed and laid out. And there's a wonderful (large) patio! Highly recommend."},{"business_id":"lok1BFflfV17T04k-Q-G9Q","review_id":"R86qgVAbPRSQlFYFCkedfA","date":"2021-03-04T03:07:02","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9343299865722656,"text_excerpt":"This place is so so great, I'm so happy it opened in my neighborhood. There are a couple things here so I want to hit them: 1) increasing community spaces. This place is clearly built to give people somewhere to be in community. That is ALWAYS a good thing - I love being able to walk for 10 minutes or take a quick bike ride to a place nearby that I feel comfortable at. There are tables / outlets / wifi so you can work. There's also a great, spacious patio area! 2) the coffee. It's really really good. I got a specialty drink called \"If Beale Street Could Talk\" which was fantastic and not too sweet. My partner got an iced vanilla latte which was also delicious. I'm eagerly awaiting trying t..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"lok1BFflfV17T04k-Q-G9Q","photo_id":"hO3lSlbYjuiXbBGNvbX6YA","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/hO3lSlbYjuiXbBGNvbX6YA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.877092182636261},{"business_id":"lok1BFflfV17T04k-Q-G9Q","photo_id":"hd2PsISIAOb1CD6HEW5TmQ","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/hd2PsISIAOb1CD6HEW5TmQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.851639986038208},{"business_id":"lok1BFflfV17T04k-Q-G9Q","photo_id":"lANz7GmJ0qZ5BLPxECtSxg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/lANz7GmJ0qZ5BLPxECtSxg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8397040367126465},{"business_id":"lok1BFflfV17T04k-Q-G9Q","photo_id":"O-oORj3mI4YIUU2cUBYP3Q","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/O-oORj3mI4YIUU2cUBYP3Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8047603368759155},{"business_id":"lok1BFflfV17T04k-Q-G9Q","photo_id":"nxk2cZRdVSyzBA103kOxTQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/nxk2cZRdVSyzBA103kOxTQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7693010568618774}]},"notebook_case":null}
